* text.div = "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p><b>TD.DT.03 Does the national schedule count this dose?</b></p><p>For one Immunization in the child's record, decide whether the schedule evaluation counts it as given.</p><p>Requirements: STD-SCH-001, STD-SEM-001. Hit policy FIRST: the rules are tried in order and the first that matches applies.</p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><th>Rule</th><th>When</th><th>Then</th><th>Why</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>primarySource is false</td><td>counts = false; why = Reported, not verified</td><td>A reported dose (J2: TrustDemoJ2HepBReported) is shown but not counted.</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>primarySource is true and hasScheduleCode is false</td><td>counts = false; why = Unmapped: shown to the clinician</td><td>A verified dose with no schedule code (TD.DT.02 unmapped) cannot be read by the schedule, which works on schedule codes.</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>primarySource is true and hasScheduleCode is true</td><td>counts = true; why = Counted as given</td><td>STD-SCH-001: counted by its schedule code and date, wherever it was given (J3: TrustDemoJ3HepB, TrustDemoJ3Bcg).</td></tr></table><p>Depends on: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-TrustDemoOnesaImmunization.html\">TrustDemoOnesaImmunization</a>, <a href=\"StructureDefinition-TrustDemoOnesaReportedImmunization.html\">TrustDemoOnesaReportedImmunization</a>.</p><p>Source: <a href=\"https://github.com/litlfred/smart-trust-demo/blob/main/processes/content/decisions/dose-counts.dmn\">dose-counts.dmn</a> (OMG DMN 1.3).</p></div>"
